-- Aurora RLS-parity restoration script (VTID-04084)
--
-- Generated 2026-09-18 from a live snapshot of Supabase's actual
-- pg_policies + pg_class.relrowsecurity for schema public. Restores the
-- row-level security Aurora is currently missing: DMS's full-load task
-- runs in TARGET_TABLE_PREP_MODE=DROP_AND_CREATE, which silently drops
-- and rebuilds each table from column-only DDL, discarding any RLS
-- policies the schema-replay migrations had put there. Measured live:
-- Supabase has RLS enabled on 605/608 tables with 1,119 policies;
-- Aurora currently has 15/605 tables and 42 policies.
--
-- REQUIRES TABLE-OWNER OR SUPERUSER PRIVILEGES on Aurora -- confirmed
-- live that the read-only `vitana/aurora/prod/claude-readonly` Data API
-- credential does NOT have enough privilege (`must be owner of table`,
-- SQLState 42501) to run ALTER TABLE ... ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY or
-- CREATE POLICY. Run this via a credential that owns the tables (e.g.
-- whatever ran the original schema-replay migrations -- likely
-- `vitana/aurora/prod/database-url` or `vitana/aurora/prod/master-password`
-- in Secrets Manager; confirm ownership before running, don't assume).
--
-- Every dependency this DDL needs was confirmed present on Aurora before
-- generating it: the auth/anon/authenticated/service_role roles the
-- policies reference, and the auth.uid()/auth.jwt()/auth.role()/
-- auth.email() shim functions the USING/WITH CHECK expressions call.
--
-- Idempotent in practice, not by construction: ALTER TABLE ... ENABLE
-- ROW LEVEL SECURITY is safe to re-run (no-op if already enabled).
-- CREATE POLICY is NOT idempotent -- re-running this against a table
-- that already has some of these policies will fail with
-- "policy ... already exists" on those specific statements. Run once;
-- if it needs a partial re-run after a failure, drop the policies that
-- did apply first, or filter this file to the remaining statements.
--
-- Regenerate before running if meaningful time has passed since
-- 2026-09-18 (re-run the query in the VTID-04084 addendum of
-- docs/AURORA-MIGRATION-STATUS-2026-09-10.md) -- concurrent work on the
-- shared Supabase project could add/change policies before the real
-- cutover window.
--
-- 1,664 statements total: 605 ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY + policy
-- CREATE statements, one per line.

